{"question_id":"TEST-DB-12","course":"数据库原理","question":"同一个数据库实验提交成功两次，助教依据平台的哪一版评阅？","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"direct","gold_answer":"以相应入口关闭前最后一次成功提交的版本为准。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"DB-01","locator":{"type":"docx_paragraph","start":10,"end":10}},{"doc_id":"DB-07","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":15,"end":15}}]}
{"question_id":"TEST-DB-13","course":"数据库原理","question":"QL-T03 第二轮从基础快照开始。假设会话甲先扣减成功并提交，会话乙随后按余额条件尝试扣减。哪张拟用单可以登记，最终 A31 的可借量是多少？","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"paraphrase_multi","gold_answer":"甲成功扣减 4 件，可登记 T411。A31 初始可借 5 件，剩 1 件不足以满足乙的 3 件申请，因此 T412 不登记，最终可借 1 件。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"DB-04","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","start":1,"end":2}},{"doc_id":"DB-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":5,"end":5}}]}
{"question_id":"TEST-DB-14","course":"数据库原理","question":"S102 的 9 月批按课程日期边界筛选借用档案，暂且不按状态和签收过滤。请列出入批单号，并指出哪条最容易误收的边界记录应排除。","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"paraphrase_multi","gold_answer":"入批 L301、L302、L303。L304 的领出日期为 10 月 1 日，在上界之外。规定按领出日期筛选，从 9 月 1 日起至 10 月 1 日之前。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"DB-03","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","start":1,"end":1}},{"doc_id":"DB-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":9,"end":9}},{"doc_id":"DB-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":11,"end":11}}]}
