{"question_id":"TEST-NET-13","course":"计算机网络","question":"隙岚展运站在 D6-B 改了哪项终端设置？D6-C 恢复基线后，这项设置应该恢复成哪个地址？","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"paraphrase_multi","gold_answer":"D6-B 只改变终端的解析节点设置。D6-C 恢复基线后，解析节点应恢复为 198.51.100.61。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"NET-04","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","start":2,"end":2}},{"doc_id":"NET-04","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","start":3,"end":3}},{"doc_id":"NET-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":31,"end":31}},{"doc_id":"NET-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":7,"end":7}}]}
{"question_id":"TEST-NET-14","course":"计算机网络","question":"按课堂相对计时，M092 中两次无应答的探测各在第几秒发出？如果把这轮结果写进进阶复核单，应该存入哪个档案？","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"paraphrase_multi","gold_answer":"无应答是第 2、4 次探测，分别在第 11 秒和第 13 秒发出。进阶复核单统一存入 XL-M09。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"NET-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":19,"end":19}},{"doc_id":"NET-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":21,"end":21}},{"doc_id":"NET-03","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","start":3,"end":3}}]}
{"question_id":"TEST-NET-15","course":"计算机网络","question":"计算机网络实验一提交前，报告要明确所用拓扑、对应的前台默认网关和平台入口。请填写这三项。","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"paraphrase_multi","gold_answer":"拓扑为 WHE-04，前台网段默认网关是 192.0.2.1，平台入口为「链路初查」。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"NET-02","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","start":1,"end":1}},{"doc_id":"NET-05","locator":{"type":"docx_paragraph","start":5,"end":5}},{"doc_id":"NET-07","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":19,"end":19}}]}
